                  U_i \cap U_j \cap U_k \to U(1)
          %p
            and the condition on quadruple overlaps
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi U
                    %mi i
                  %mo ∩
                  %msub
                    %mi U
                    %mi j
                  %mo ∩
                  %msub
                    %mi U
                    %mi k
                  %mo ∩
                  %msub
                    %mi U
                    %mi l
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U_i \cap U_j \cap U_k \cap U_l
            says that they satisfy
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi λ
