                induced from the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kac-Moody+central+extension"} Kac-Moody central extension
                of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/loop+group"} loop group
                of
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
