          %p Using these tools, the stages of the above smooth Whitehead tower are constructed as follows:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                the morphism
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
