            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+QFT"} effective QFT
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
            the bosonic massless field content consists locally of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/graviton"} graviton
            and a 3-form
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi C
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                Due to the existence of
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spinors"} spinors
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spin+connection"} spin connection
