            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TQFT"} topological
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+functional"} action functional
            given by the
            %a{:href => "intersection+pairing#SecondaryIntersectionPairing"} secondary intersection pairing
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+dimensional+Chern-Simons+theory"} 7d Chern-Simons theory
            (or in fact, if quantum corrections are taken into account, a generalization of that to
            = succeed "-2-form" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
