          %p
            This is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integral+kernel"} integral kernel
            induced by the action functional, and acting on spaces of sections of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+prequantum+line+bundle"} higher prequantum line bundle
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+map"} linear map
            induced by these higher
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integral+kernels"} integral kernels
            is to be the
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+propagator"} quantum propagator
          %p
            Notice that forming co-sections constitutes an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-functor"} (∞,1)-functor
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
