                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/master+thesis+Nuiten"} Cohomological quantization of local boundary prequantum field theory
            %li
              %p#SchreiberSynthetic
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
                ,
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Synthetic+Quantum+Field+Theory"} Synthetic Quantum Field Theory
          %p A general theory of such smooth homotopy-types is laid out in
          %ul#Schreiber
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+a+cohesive+topos"} differential cohomology in a cohesive topos
          %p
            The observation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+%28infinity%2C1%29-topos"} tangent (infinity,1)-topos
            is due to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Joyal"}> André Joyal
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Notes on Logoi
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/IMA/JOYAL/Joyal.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \,
          %p Section A) above originates in notes for an introductory lecture:
          %ul#SchreiberLect
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"}> Urs Schreiber
              ,
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://maths-old.anu.edu.au/esi/2012/program.html#Schreiber"} Twisted differential structures in string theory
              at
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://maths-old.anu.edu.au/esi/2012/"} ESI Program on K-Theory and Quantum Fields
              (2012)
          %p Closely related lectures at the same program included
          %ul#FreedLecture
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Freed"}> Dan Freed
              ,
              %em
                Lectures on twisted
                = succeed "-theory" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi K
